OL,3,GNEWSAPost Office saved for Christmas
OL,4,Abrings 'tears'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple who have saved a Devon town
OL,7,Ffrom life without a post office have
OL,8,Fspoken of their future customers'
OL,9,Fpositive reaction, saying one pensioner
OL,10,Fwas left crying at the news.
OL,12,FStephen and Teresa Smith have created a
OL,13,FPost Office branch in the former HSBC
OL,14,Fbuilding in Exmouth's Chapel Street
OL,15,Fafter the branch operating from the
OL,16,Flocal TG Jones, formerly WH Smith,
OL,17,Fstore closed down.
OL,19,FThe Post Office said at the time it
OL,20,Fhoped to find a replacement branch -
OL,21,Fwith customers directed elsewhere in
OL,22,Fthe meantime.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
