OL,3,GNEWSAPost Office saved for Christmas
OL,4,Abrings 'tears'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStephen Smith, now the local
OL,7,Fpostmaster, said: "A lady in her early
OL,8,F80s was in tears. She couldn't believe
OL,9,Fit was back open - she thought she'd
OL,10,Flost her post office."
